{"hash": "b5c6123f1d88fcc82c1167f8a4c72eaf3d1576666c89831e3b2bece9a8fb31d6", "id": "T-t1-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "genesis", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 7, "line_start": 7, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. A human must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "84bceca41b2b9e6b689d6695166c19b6a6ded67cda86be83a2c871a99cf2db1f", "id": "T-t1-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "b5c6123f1d88fcc82c1167f8a4c72eaf3d1576666c89831e3b2bece9a8fb31d6", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 8, "line_start": 8, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. An agent must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "a86a65c29a36e78fe284be196ce397d6b7e82164029329e98a3f90ceaa1688fb", "id": "T-t1-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "84bceca41b2b9e6b689d6695166c19b6a6ded67cda86be83a2c871a99cf2db1f", "section": "T1", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 9, "line_start": 9, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. An internal or external event must be able to enter the system.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "6d01db4597e53ad093375dc1fb184d32f623f68d81d5f49a8ff1069e996afc05", "id": "T-t2-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "a86a65c29a36e78fe284be196ce397d6b7e82164029329e98a3f90ceaa1688fb", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 13, "line_start": 13, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Composability hides the complexity.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "50c2a2dd8a7bcc0f56acfae50c327aeb08f92941723703fd3a3ff702a60ebb50", "id": "T-t2-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "6d01db4597e53ad093375dc1fb184d32f623f68d81d5f49a8ff1069e996afc05", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 14, "line_start": 14, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Composability allows enhancing particular aspects of any element without touching the rest.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "4cfd9c76d00caa6cd8ae3fe2968d7106c6c116d4b144674687357675d5594c43", "id": "T-t2-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "50c2a2dd8a7bcc0f56acfae50c327aeb08f92941723703fd3a3ff702a60ebb50", "section": "T2", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 15, "line_start": 15, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. State, telemetry, and every cross-cutting concern are managed across the entire structure, whichever entry point was used.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "580533ab157f989a2dd083a0673900e3b059e5dc386653e22fe021ee4f9cd81c", "id": "T-t3-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "4cfd9c76d00caa6cd8ae3fe2968d7106c6c116d4b144674687357675d5594c43", "section": "T3", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 19, "line_start": 19, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. It has to be simple to use.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "cfa769894fbb1b4b80a704bb704b0c64fee5853e15fefbe533f15973fb33abb3", "id": "T-t3-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "580533ab157f989a2dd083a0673900e3b059e5dc386653e22fe021ee4f9cd81c", "section": "T3", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 20, "line_start": 20, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. It cannot be daunting or overly complex, or no one will use it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "b43e0cba58e4aeae3a57bc2489d0724c6c3b36cc9b8c134d04364b92a0901cd1", "id": "T-t4-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "cfa769894fbb1b4b80a704bb704b0c64fee5853e15fefbe533f15973fb33abb3", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 24, "line_start": 24, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Treat this as a baseline target and improve on it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "fb47c683aa764e4e8c00f1699942359eaac007634492f233834a8d4073248eeb", "id": "T-t4-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "b43e0cba58e4aeae3a57bc2489d0724c6c3b36cc9b8c134d04364b92a0901cd1", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 25, "line_start": 25, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Decompose it; add the skills, loops, and agents needed to reach it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "43e67c057cc8df0d21c2e3934f5dbdf25f430efebd5cfa2e7c2384464243dcae", "id": "T-t4-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "fb47c683aa764e4e8c00f1699942359eaac007634492f233834a8d4073248eeb", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 26, "line_start": 26, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. PASS.md's list is a limited baseline: understand what an end-to-end version is, make up for the gaps, and solve it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "d414b200fa3eecc0a70d43e434af4a33554ea713a85f774f379891ee87de1d01", "id": "T-t4-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "43e67c057cc8df0d21c2e3934f5dbdf25f430efebd5cfa2e7c2384464243dcae", "section": "T4", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 27, "line_start": 27, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Work through every item with a self-improvement loop: at the end of each section a ceremony re-reviews the output, improves the skills that produced it, and the loop continues.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "72f10c870a86a144b6b1473726e88ac0b04d07b7d25de78eaaed83a79eb9be42", "id": "T-t5-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "d414b200fa3eecc0a70d43e434af4a33554ea713a85f774f379891ee87de1d01", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 31, "line_start": 31, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. Do not stop at ceremonies; run them and continue.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "ac4e0114ec427e2bc71c5a8d669ef51dcd515eea31f181862782be971fc9d86d", "id": "T-t5-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "72f10c870a86a144b6b1473726e88ac0b04d07b7d25de78eaaed83a79eb9be42", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 32, "line_start": 32, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. When a problem comes up, use 1-3-1: define the problem, identify the three best possible solutions that align to the goal, and follow the recommendation.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "45c0c8ba3572a3e3d4737854c91f720f033287509278392f22c313b8dc297344", "id": "T-t5-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "ac4e0114ec427e2bc71c5a8d669ef51dcd515eea31f181862782be971fc9d86d", "section": "T5", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 33, "line_start": 33, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. If no recommendation is found, drop the two lowest solutions, find two more, and repeat until solved.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "2bfad2d4c2675694dbae0aa1c84eca3014a5fbdb3f726cdd49dc8fe1edad96b5", "id": "T-t6-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "45c0c8ba3572a3e3d4737854c91f720f033287509278392f22c313b8dc297344", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 37, "line_start": 37, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. There is one way to consume the platform, shown as code end to end: what is called, with what, and what comes back.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "207184aa10cabc7f6b8d6732b41de727cd56e48ad2458c75980909dbdd110e9d", "id": "T-t6-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "2bfad2d4c2675694dbae0aa1c84eca3014a5fbdb3f726cdd49dc8fe1edad96b5", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 38, "line_start": 38, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Four entries cover nearly every situation: a human, an event, a schedule (time), and an external system or agent. All four enter through the same shape.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "d93599bae505ac176a5d2b3d53dd5c1144bdb385fc089bd0a3bee4fee9cf53e5", "id": "T-t6-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "207184aa10cabc7f6b8d6732b41de727cd56e48ad2458c75980909dbdd110e9d", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 39, "line_start": 39, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. Any entry can call complex workflows, agents, and loops that run across the entire stack.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "420d06ad26c00058d341f1e63a9ccb5a57880f48d6d80bd4833de42ac80fa946", "id": "T-t6-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "d93599bae505ac176a5d2b3d53dd5c1144bdb385fc089bd0a3bee4fee9cf53e5", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 40, "line_start": 40, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Multiple models are used through one gateway, and a fleet of GPUs serves local models; callers request a model class, not a vendor.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "bc875d2d5b197e4f847381ffa9148089b3c1eeaa36901c3c2be148310de8b841", "id": "T-t6-05", "index": 5, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "420d06ad26c00058d341f1e63a9ccb5a57880f48d6d80bd4833de42ac80fa946", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 41, "line_start": 41, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "5. Each agent is defined up front by what it is good at, so callers know how to call it and how to sequence it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "02179c7088bc840e07bc7ae04569eaa5c51138ead7d8cb21aff9ac120217627b", "id": "T-t6-06", "index": 6, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "bc875d2d5b197e4f847381ffa9148089b3c1eeaa36901c3c2be148310de8b841", "section": "T6", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 42, "line_start": 42, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "6. The target scale is well over a hundred agents running at a time, working together, managing state, breaking problems down, and self-improving where they can.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "c4162be00206989fe55c4ab4bd33d35187b670f3dbfa837f85d53d08e2473e14", "id": "T-t7-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "02179c7088bc840e07bc7ae04569eaa5c51138ead7d8cb21aff9ac120217627b", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 46, "line_start": 46, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. The harness is an overlay that integrates across every component fluidly; it never pins the integration to a component.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "7dee59cbb016f363c9f4e3623d4963619970887fdafa2e7831d31ede78933cc0", "id": "T-t7-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "c4162be00206989fe55c4ab4bd33d35187b670f3dbfa837f85d53d08e2473e14", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 47, "line_start": 47, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Every harness call goes through the capability interface, and the component sits behind an adapter.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "047d9a91860c32871317f2d7b170c48987a89bfe53177603886d9b65a33b5cba", "id": "T-t7-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "7dee59cbb016f363c9f4e3623d4963619970887fdafa2e7831d31ede78933cc0", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 48, "line_start": 48, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. Each component has a minimal call in isolation, and the same calls are linked across the composable elements.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "fe1896ca1f50a93880a703ef478141d6b4594442288a31d0432eda880f084d6f", "id": "T-t7-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "047d9a91860c32871317f2d7b170c48987a89bfe53177603886d9b65a33b5cba", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 49, "line_start": 49, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Standards will change, systems will change, and components will change; the harness shows where the impacts are.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "e547cb9683bf4e090a5aa903ce0eb2003b2a0bdb68280b6be45d6d5b5310fd18", "id": "T-t7-05", "index": 5, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "fe1896ca1f50a93880a703ef478141d6b4594442288a31d0432eda880f084d6f", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 50, "line_start": 50, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "5. Changing a component means swapping its adapter, and the conformance run proves the interface held.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "0c08545b1cd5adea68da79006e21e0d53b516c950fd6d4069ae41f8c4cfd18ea", "id": "T-t7-06", "index": 6, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "e547cb9683bf4e090a5aa903ce0eb2003b2a0bdb68280b6be45d6d5b5310fd18", "section": "T7", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 51, "line_start": 51, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "6. This direction is a target toward perfection, not a fixed definition; improve on it.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "6d2c99dda57794fbc799b056563b56b5a0427325273f2393108f76fcf9d44ada", "id": "T-t8-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "0c08545b1cd5adea68da79006e21e0d53b516c950fd6d4069ae41f8c4cfd18ea", "section": "T8", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 55, "line_start": 55, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. The twelve host-fact gaps in docs/architecture/gap-triage.json are absent on the host today and are design work, not facts to research.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "04c428264ae696d44b1503cf279005072a4fc517e7d31be694357829158362cd", "id": "T-t8-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "6d2c99dda57794fbc799b056563b56b5a0427325273f2393108f76fcf9d44ada", "section": "T8", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 56, "line_start": 56, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Standard-version gaps and does-a-standard-exist gaps are closed by research with real search results, or recorded as none found.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "863d9656be1f3dabbb0168bd16e44856b84f10dd276358aa4a179195c077d14e", "id": "T-t9-01", "index": 1, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "04c428264ae696d44b1503cf279005072a4fc517e7d31be694357829158362cd", "section": "T9", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 60, "line_start": 60, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "1. The improvement loop works the metric furthest from its target and stops when every target holds or the owner says stop.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "672ecd7046a2a309f011eb219a1c0a688bc1d3a14869febf013cee331bfc6b85", "id": "T-t9-02", "index": 2, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "863d9656be1f3dabbb0168bd16e44856b84f10dd276358aa4a179195c077d14e", "section": "T9", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 61, "line_start": 61, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "2. Sourced share: proposed rows are under 30 percent of all rows.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "042cf73ae27a1808b367aafc58993935fcb3aa66e253897cffd131beeecc98f9", "id": "T-t9-03", "index": 3, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "672ecd7046a2a309f011eb219a1c0a688bc1d3a14869febf013cee331bfc6b85", "section": "T9", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 62, "line_start": 62, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "3. Restatement: the validator reports zero restatement warnings.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "239510df38eaa6bcd188687ac2426e41a99147b1ba84627fe29807664de534e8", "id": "T-t9-04", "index": 4, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "042cf73ae27a1808b367aafc58993935fcb3aa66e253897cffd131beeecc98f9", "section": "T9", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 63, "line_start": 63, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "4. Measured done: at least half of all definitions of done have a measured run.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "e2bb90d161d5878ecfb8d846976838a8935ff8e69f34b85c935884b9fc2dc23f", "id": "T-t9-05", "index": 5, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "239510df38eaa6bcd188687ac2426e41a99147b1ba84627fe29807664de534e8", "section": "T9", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 64, "line_start": 64, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "5. Load path: a builder reads at most 11 skills for one common task per door.", "type": "fact"}
{"hash": "62bb3447aea6cfa259cd8139ef4b662c0e406411c0c8d5518c9be9477e56f6ea", "id": "T-t9-06", "index": 6, "kind": "item", "part": "T", "prev": "e2bb90d161d5878ecfb8d846976838a8935ff8e69f34b85c935884b9fc2dc23f", "section": "T9", "source": {"file": "TARGET.md", "line_end": 65, "line_start": 65, "sha256": "c0ce20aae87d740e41197d5fc5b674057de509e56db604d2e668793b417a87d2"}, "status": "target-owner", "text": "6. Swaps proven: every harness section executes one adapter swap with the conformance run before and after.", "type": "fact"}
